  {
    "name": "get_market_klines",
    "title": null,
    "description": "取一段规范化历史 K 线(裸 OHLCV，不做任何加工)。\n\n出参: {exchange, symbol, interval, tz:\"UTC\", candles:[{t,o,h,l,c,v,a}], cache_hit, count, partial}\n  - t: open 时间(UTC 毫秒)；o/h/l/c/v: 数值；a: 可选成交额，无可靠值时为 null。\n  - 只含**已收盘**的 K 线；当前未收盘的那根不返回。\n  - cache_hit: 本次是否全部命中缓存(true 即未出网)。\n  - partial: 上游未能证明完整覆盖；note 说明缺口原因，未确认区间不会写入 coverage。",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "as_of": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "format": "date-time",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "带时区的可见性截止时间；只返回该时点已完成的 K 线",
          "title": "As Of"
        },
        "cache": {
          "default": false,
          "description": "是否写入 SQLite 缓存；默认可读已有数据但不写入，显式设为 true 才留存",
          "title": "Cache",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "end": {
          "description": "结束：同 start 格式(UTC)",
          "title": "End"
        },
        "exchange": {
          "default": "binance",
          "description": "交易所：binance | okx | bybit | aster | hyperliquid | xueqiu | tencent | sina | ths",
          "title": "Exchange",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "include_open": {
          "default": false,
          "description": "是否包含当前未收盘 K 线；仅可与 cache=false 同时使用",
          "title": "Include Open",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "interval": {
          "description": "K 线周期，如 1m/5m/1h/4h/1d；各所支持的档位不同",
          "title": "Interval",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "start": {
          "description": "起始：ISO 日期 YYYY-MM-DD / ISO 时间 / 毫秒时间戳(UTC)",
          "title": "Start"
        },
        "symbol": {
          "description": "优先使用 ccxt 统一写法：现货 BTC/USDT；永续 BTC/USDT:USDT(binance/okx/bybit/aster)、BTC/USDC:USDC(hyperliquid)；也接受只对应一个市场的交易所原生代码，如 Binance TradFi 的 HK0700USDT、UNITREEUSDT；股票源 A股 SH600519/SZ000001，同花顺概念指数 THS885844，雪球港股推荐 HK00700（兼容 00700，内部自动去掉 HK）、美股 SPCX",
          "title": "Symbol",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "symbol",
        "interval",
        "start",
        "end"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "execution": null,
    "outputSchema": null,
    "icons": null,
    "annotations": null,
    "_meta": null
  },
  {
    "name": "get_market_window",
    "title": null,
    "description": "复盘取数：给锚定日期，取其**前 days_before 天 ~ 后 days_after 天**的 K 线。\n\n语义：以锚点当天 00:00(UTC)为界，窗口 =\n    [锚点 - days_before 天, 锚点 + (days_after+1) 天 - 1ms]\n即含锚点当天在内、往后再数 days_after 个整天。内部换算成一次 klines 取数，\n出参与 /market/klines 一致，另附 window 字段说明实际窗口。",
    "inputSchema": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "anchor": {
          "description": "锚定日期(复盘中心)：ISO 日期 / 时间 / 毫秒",
          "title": "Anchor"
        },
        "cache": {
          "default": false,
          "description": "是否写入 SQLite 缓存；默认可读已有数据但不写入，显式设为 true 才留存",
          "title": "Cache",
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "days_after": {
          "default": 3,
          "description": "锚点往后几天(默认 3)，含锚点当天",
          "maximum": 365,
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Days After",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "days_before": {
          "default": 3,
          "description": "锚点往前几天(默认 3)",
          "maximum": 365,
          "minimum": 0,
          "title": "Days Before",
          "type": "integer"
        },
        "exchange": {
          "default": "binance",
          "description": "交易所：binance | okx | bybit | aster | hyperliquid | xueqiu | tencent | sina | ths",
          "title": "Exchange",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "interval": {
          "description": "K 线周期，如 1m/5m/1h/4h/1d",
          "title": "Interval",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "symbol": {
          "description": "优先使用 ccxt 统一写法：现货 BTC/USDT；永续 BTC/USDT:USDT(binance/okx/bybit/aster)、BTC/USDC:USDC(hyperliquid)；也接受只对应一个市场的交易所原生代码，如 Binance TradFi 的 HK0700USDT、UNITREEUSDT；股票源 A股 SH600519/SZ000001，同花顺概念指数 THS885844，雪球港股推荐 HK00700（兼容 00700，内部自动去掉 HK）、美股 SPCX",
          "title": "Symbol",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "symbol",
        "interval",
        "anchor"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    },
    "execution": null,
    "outputSchema": null,
    "icons": null,
    "annotations": null,
    "_meta": null
